wer  all of the many unsolved mysteries in  the series I really don't see any other  way to get a satisfying ending either we  will need a lot more than four or five  chapters or we will need a direct  continuation of the story even if it is  under another name but please let me  know what you guys think is the story  really ending in just a few more  chapters and if so what kind of end  could we possibly be getting can you see  the ending being satisfying or good in  any way or would it have to be extremely  rushed and anticlimactic hit me up with  your feedback down in the comments below  if you enjoyed this video you want us to  keep the seven deadly sins content going  please leave a like to let me know it  really does help and if you happen to be  new to anime uproar or if you just  haven't subscribed yet please subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all notifications if you want to be  notified and you don't want YouTube to  bury our videos you have to go through  the trouble of clicking the bell and  selecting the option that says all you  can also hit me up on Twitter and  Instagram at anime uproar I want to give  a big thank you to all of our anime out  pro patrons for supporting our work and  making these videos possible with all  the constant problems on YouTube patron  support is more important than ever  thank you guys so much  first and foremost a special thank you  to our the one tier patrons the ones who  rise above all other clans including in  grata alone Adam the world stealers the  school bus  Tyson Karina acquired respect and Pat a  heffa and I can't forget our pro hero  tier patrons including the one and only  Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason Wilson  Kings eldred's fitted ala beat alpha do  Anatoli Cassatt's ki on hell Cruz team  Sparky 65 cricket XP Rohan Kapoor  Jessica Maloney Emperor otaku Timothy  Vargas Sean dark Joe Stanton JCCC waka  Barrie Gucci and Jessica Calif all if  you enjoy our videos and you think that  they provide value for you consider  supporting us on patreon even a single  dollar will give you access to our  patron exclusive discord and your name  will appear in our videos along with  these legendary people as always thank  you guys so much for watching and until  next time see us bass cowboys  [Music]
 

